From eef30bb3098307966d88bbe807f7d9c8b1aaa7bb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Tue, 23 Jun 2026 16:37:51 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] FIX route selected-agent slash commands through backend
 execution so they are not sent as prompts

Selected-agent messages whose first token is a slash command use the provider command hook instead of the normal prompt send path. Codex maps that hook to app-server command calls for existing threads, while providers without command support return an unsupported-command error through the provider-neutral API.
